          "notes": [
            "The full actual Jinan University Application Guide for International Students2026 was independently read. The complete section9 is explicitly named College Prep Program at Jinan University(2026) and says applicants who do not meet undergraduate admission criteria may enroll in one-year preparatory courses in arts or science. This is a concrete preparatory programme named by the institution, not a generic high-school eligibility category, course unit or an inferred bachelor degree.",
            "The same international-student guide describes Preparatory ClassA and ClassB as routes within this programme, with different progression pathways. They are retained as source context and are not turned into separate programme identities. Arts/sciences tracks and the2026 year are likewise not new identities. Only the literal parent name College Prep Program is selected, while its preparatory non-degree category is independently explicit in that same complete paragraph.",
            "All eleven current raw same-school programmes and actual updated identity bindings were independently reread at dfd base, including every locale, degree category, official-code field, alias and URL. All eleven existing programmes are bachelors: InternationalEconomicsandTrade, ComputerScience, Accounting, Finance, Pharmacy, InternationalJournalism, FoodNutrition, ClinicalMedicine, ChineseLanguage, ChineseLanguageandCultureEducation and TCSOL. No existing foundation or same-qualified preparatory identity exists. The shared official guide URL does not make these different bachelor subjects aliases of the prep programme.",
            "The actual programme source is an international-student application guide whose concrete section9 defines the preparatory route. It explicitly names Jinan University as owner. This is 暨南大学/JNU, not UniversityofJinan/济南大学. Only the exact English label is approved and no Chinese/Russian translation is invented. Section9 is an ordinal, and no programme or department code is supplied.",
            "This action confirms stable prep-programme identity only. The source has past2026 application dates. It does not approve current enrolment, routes of guaranteed progression, qualification exceptions, fees, duration, language, exam scores, funding or scholarship eligibility. No fields of the eleven bachelors are renewed. Historical STOPs and unknown model attempts remain unchanged; this source-only reading is not a model/human review receipt.",
